  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fbstylia\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MineshaftsMonsters/bh_promo.png\"></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jWb8QmP/dc-logo.png\" alt=\"dc-logo\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">特色一览...</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 数十种拥有独特攻击模式和动画的Boss</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 数百种全新的动物与怪物</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 数百种全新的建筑结构</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 完整的主线任务与自定义任务系统</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 独特的声望系统</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 魂系战斗系统</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">⚔️&nbsp; 超过200个精心挑选的模组</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7wfi9rbrGVI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kLeTRSq_mTk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">重要说明：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 如果您决定自行编辑整合包，请勿删除 Dawncraft_Resources 或 Dawncraft_Datapack，否则会导致错误。</p>\n<p>- 为 DawnCraft 分配至少6GB内存，推荐8-12GB。超过此范围可能导致过度占用。</p>\n<p>- 确保已安装 Java 18 或 17，否则可能引发崩溃。</p>\n<p>- macOS 用户需使用 LITE 版本，若想游玩完整版请参考此文档：<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iZ1TjJCDNyUZlEMn6S7JM_d9xQcNk2OktmxUOGdi6do/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">翻译补丁：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em><strong>2.0版本翻译补丁：</strong></em></p>\n<p>西班牙语翻译补丁：<a href=\"https://github.com/Mexes-GM/DawnCraft-Traduccion-ES\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p>巴西葡萄牙语翻译补丁（制作中）：<a href=\"https://github.com/GMalvestiti/dawncraft_lang_pt_br\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p>法语翻译补丁：<a href=\"https://github.com/fouirux/Dawncraft-French-translation/tree/main\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>[链接]</strong></a></p>\n<p>中文翻译补丁：<a href=\"https://github.com/VM-Chinese-translate-group/dawncraft-Chinese-patch-Pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p><em><strong>1.0版本翻译补丁：</strong></em></p>\n<p>俄语翻译补丁（制作中）：<a href=\"https://github.com/ItDanieru/dawncraft_lang_Uk_Be_Ru\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p>西班牙语翻译补丁（制作中）：<a href=\"https://github.com/ByAlexTTV/Dawncraft-Espanol\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p>俄语翻译补丁（备选）：<a href=\"https://github.com/Skyderlock/Skyderlock-s-Dawncraft-Translation-Pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p><strong>如果您有兴趣进行DawnCraft材料翻译，相关文件位于：</strong></p>\n<p>- 村民任务 (global_packs\\required_data\\DawnCraft_Datapack\\data\\quest_giver\\quests)</p>\n<p>- FTB任务信息 (config\\ftbquests\\quests\\chapters)</p>\n<p>- 人类NPC任务 <a href=\"https://github.com/SmileycorpMC/DawnCraft-Tweaks/tree/master/src/main/resources/assets/dawncraft/lang\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p>\n<p>- DawnCraft Mobs lang文件</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">内容创作者资源：</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rbhVG0HVC51ByWOecEeOb-kzTd71jY89?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">有问题？加入我们的Discord。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fUjPx5jzd3m\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:'book antiqua', palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EuHBB1X.png\" width=\"233\" height=\"97\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">鸣谢与版权：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>来自savage and ravage的纹理仅用于在Epic Fight和Savage and Ravage之间添加兼容性。Savage and Ravage和Placebo是'DawnCraft Mobs'模组加载所必需的依赖项。其仅作为资源补丁，旨在改善玩家在整合包中使用savage and ravage时的体验。补丁前：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fPDxb92d\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a> 补丁后：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fibb.co%252fqJWs7KF\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a> 查看DawnCraft Mobs使用的依赖项及新增调整，请参见'DawnCraft Mobs'的依赖项部分。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dawncraft-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></li>\n<li>使用的数据包：城镇与塔楼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252ftowns-amp-towers-structure-overhaul%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a>，女巫突袭 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fdata-pack%252fwitch-raids-1-18%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a></li>\n<li>未在CurseForge上的资源包：天际音效包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fsoundpack-skyrim-175%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">[链接]</a>，Improved Mounting by METAL（来自EpicFight Discord），Jet and Elia's Armor Re-textured by ScourgeII（来自EpicFight Discord）</li>\n<li>感谢Epic Fight团队的所有开发者（Yesman, Metal, RK）协助处理所有Epic Fight兼容性问题</li>\n<li>感谢Lord Snow协助修复错误和兼容性补丁</li>\n<li>感谢Nitsu制作所有Boss及预告片音乐</li>\n<li>感谢Blackcocofish允许使用其部分生物资源</li>\n<li>感谢brier24允许使用洞穴居者和沙虫模型！</li>\n<li>感谢BisectHosting团队在我们上线首日将服务器包集成到他们的系统中</li>\n<li>感谢所有赞助者</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
